{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/12/1880644/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーさむいっ( pq  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お布団に包まりながら\n書いてますっ( ^ω^ )♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くるくるくるー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は。せいだを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまで書いて、気づいたら眠っちゃってました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいぶ寝ぼけてたみたいです(>_<)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/12/1880644/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気をとりなおして!\n昨日は、せいたんとディズニーランドに\n行ってきましたー(*^ω^*)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんラブっ∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/12/1880644/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/12/1880644/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/12/1880644/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恋人かっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/12/1880644/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく正反対って言われる2人だけど、\n一緒にいるとほんとに笑が止まらなくて、楽しいのっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/12/1880644/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会話はほとんど噛み合ってないけど、\nなんかイエイ!って感じで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/12/1880644/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人の会話は、よう!ちぇけ!いえい!\nで、できてますっ！ポジピース☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たっくさん乗り物にのって、\nいっぱいはしゃぎましたo( ^ω^ )o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね、あのね、もうね、\n伝わらないかもだけど、\nすっごーく楽しかったよ！(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/12/1880644/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乗り物乗ってるときの、2人のテンションっ＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うおあぇわぁあああっ＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やばかった＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえあ!いえあ!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニーちゃんにも会えて、写真も\n撮ってもらえたし、\n美味しいものもいっぱい食べれたし、\nパレードも楽しかったし、\nせいたんとお揃いで歯ブラシも買えたし、\nハッピーでした( ^ω^ )！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーのみんなにもお土産買ったんだー(*^ω^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/12/1880644/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、せいたんが、チュロスの名前を\n覚えられずにずっとチョリッス！\nって言ってて、\n違うよせいたん、チュロスだよお(>o<)\nって、めっちゃ面白かったあ(>p<)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとせいたん！\nまた行こうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/12/1880644/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/12/1880644/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からは、いいお天気に\nなるそおですよー∩^ω^∩やったあ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんにとって、幸せな\n一日になりますよーおに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な週末を\nお過ごしください(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/12/1880644/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、おやすみなさゆにゃん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/12/1880644/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/12/1880644/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/12/1880644/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/12/1880644/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/12/1880644/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/12/1880644/0015.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}